<title>USA: U.S. Energy files for uranium mill license.</title>
<headline>U.S. Energy files for uranium mill license.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERTON, Wyo. 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Energy Corp said that it and its 52 percent owned subsidiary, Crested Corp, filed for a performance based operating license for the Green Mountain Mining Venture's Sweetwater uranium mill.</p>
<p>The mill is located in the Red Desert of south-central Wyoming.</p>
<p>The Performance Based Operating License would transfer the status of the license from standby to operational mode and would allow greater licensee discretion during operations, U.S. Energy Corp said.</p>
</text>
